  "title": "Crabby Cream Cheese Wontons",
  "description": "Wonton wrappers are filled with cream cheese, crab meat (I use imitation, but you can use either), garlic, and onions. You just have to heat them so the cheese is melted hot. Don't overcook. Serve with rice and sweet and sour sauce. Good as an appetizer, or meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Shawn Salzman"
  ],
